{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09235","headline":"和吴舍人早春归沐西亭言志 · 韦应物","name":"和吴舍人早春归沐西亭言志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓漏戒中禁，清香肃朝衣。\n一门双掌诰，伯侍仲言归。\n亭高性情旷，职密交游稀。\n赋诗乐无事，解带偃南扉。\n阳春美时泽，旭霁望山晖。\n幽禽响未转，东原绿犹微。\n名虽列僊爵，心已遣尘机。\n即事同岩隐，圣渥良难违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}